@startuml
title AI Processing Layer Activity Diagram

start
:Receive normalized log from Ingestor;
:Parse log and extract details;
if (Trigger LLM?) then (Yes)
  :Send log and context to LLM;
  :Receive explanation and severity;
else (No)
  :Skip LLM processing;
endif
:Query RAG Connector for knowledge base entries;
:Apply Rule Engine to evaluate possible actions;
:Compile output with explanation, severity, and recommendations;
:Send processed output to API Gateway;
stop

@enduml
